category: Libs
build-depends: cygport 
sdesc: "ZiLOG Z80 CPU emulation library (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "Z80~Ex is the portable ZiLOG Z80 CPU emulator designed as a library. Goals
include : precise opcode emulation (documented & undocumented), exact timings
for each opcode (including I/O operations), multiple CPU contexts.
disassembler is also included."
skip:

homepage: https://sourceforge.net/projects/z80ex/
license: GPL-2.0-or-later
